<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- Stage 1 — brief, unavoidable, OS-level, mirroring Theme.App.Starting in
     shells/android-template's themes.xml: just a background color + centered icon, no custom
     hold condition, so the OS never shows a bare default flash. The real, brandable splash is
     Stage 2 (developer-authored HTML, see ViewController.swift's setupSplash()). -->
